The GitHub build of Fantastic Team (Team GitHub).

The general build gives workers stock exec: any command line is allowed. This
patch narrows the build for GitHub work. Workers cannot reach forge CLIs (gh,
glab, hub), git push, git credential, git remote set-url, any credential.helper
setting or api.github.com. Every GitHub action goes through the github connector,
as the app, so no credential ever reaches a worker.

It also names the build: the app is "AISixteen Fantastic Team GitHub" (identifier
com.aisixteen.team.github) and its launcher starts the fantastic_team-github
binary that scripts/build-github.sh produces.

Apply from the repo root with: git apply patches/github-exec.patch
scripts/build-github.sh does that on a copy of the tree and builds it.

